  "ingredients": [
    "1 cup sugar",
    "0.25 cup lemon juice",
    "4 cups peeled, cored and chopped apple",
    "4 cups peeled, cored and chopped pears"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients. Preheat the oven to 150 degrees F (65 degrees C). Cover a baking sheet with a layer of plastic wrap or parchment paper.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/4nUmNtEVYX589AE3cMBmHZdYpqU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/62151-fruit-leather-DDMFS-step-01-6cb462751e5e49f3bc7c267aab1c494a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/62151/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "In the container of a blender, combine the sugar, lemon juice, apple and pear. Cover and puree until smooth.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/KN1HRocEU08b6kqgdcmPIzfncvw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/62151-fruit-leather-DDMFS-step-02-af2487b917e84d97b7c19dc1a49470f8.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/62151/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spread evenly on the prepared pan. Place the pan on the top rack of the oven.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/DFs7n5iF6jBGFC3EkGwtOpw5igg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/62151-fruit-leather-DDMFS-step-03-ba1f42e8c28c4e60b72108c3d7349fb8.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/62151/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake for 5 to 6 hours, leaving the door to the oven partway open. Fruit is dry when the surface is no longer tacky and you can tear it like leather.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/FxaBtlzyzMTiGwmjI75RMo9BKAA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/62151-fruit-leather-DDMFS-step-04-2d535d4f15a048c8a9480c9818c0afcc.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/62151/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Roll up on the parchment paper or plastic wrap and store in an airtight jar.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ww0Ivke5e9fTlykiDerUPf7iH_U=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/62151-fruit-leather-DDMFS-step-05-c857e12c0ac44299addde53e7d364f03.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/62151/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cut into strips and enjoy.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/WKwSeWMJoMhcuAevFjBo28dtgZY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/62151-fruit-leather-DDMFS-step-06-fbd4b2538f5c42a8a2d8e09c459b8b19.jpg"
